		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d07r0401_workman2_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やあ！　まってたよ！
それじゃあ　さっそく　はじめようか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T12:39:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T12:38:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>やあ！　まってたよ！
それじゃあ　さっそく　はじめようか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T12:48:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T12:48:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・２回目以降
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
